
## PHP with DDEV

- DDEV runs PHP and Composer in the project's container; mise installs DDEV itself, so CI and every machine run the same gates. Docker is the only host prerequisite. `mise run setup` starts DDEV and installs the committed `composer.lock` dependencies.
- PHPStan checks types, PHP-CS-Fixer checks PER-CS, and Pest runs tests. `mise run fix` applies formatting.
- `.ddev/config.yaml`, `composer.json`, PHP tool configs and source are seeded for the project to adapt. The stack owns only its mise task defaults.
